{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S245-EXERCISE-245YD","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S245-HINT-245YD-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 245Yd","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S245-SEG-245YD","semantic_anchor":"245Yd","source_anchor":"245Yd","source_line_start":1170,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"118fa0664010129a89842ad63ad8da78aa1f8149302cd797b19204d2b1659a82","source_text":"set\n$\\gamma=\\inf_{u\\in A}\\bar\\tau_F(u)$;  find a non-increasing sequence\n$\\sequencen{u_n}$ in $A$ such that\n$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\bar\\tau_F(u_n)=\\gamma$;  set $v=(\\chi\nF)^{\\ssbullet}\\wedge\\inf_{n\\in\\Bbb N}u_n$ and show that $u\\wedge v=v$\nfor every $u\\in A$, so that $v=0$.","target_line_start":1158,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"111a5092960a329d463d9bc4a2b3f385e922b3378452945e6bf512c8ef980941","target_text":"Tetapkan $\\gamma=\\inf_{u\\in\nA}\\bar\\tau_F(u)$; temukan barisan menurun $\\sequencen{u_n}$ dalam $A$\nsehingga $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\bar\\tau_F(u_n)=\\gamma$; tetapkan $v=(\\chi\nF)^{\\ssbullet}\\wedge\\inf_{n\\in\\Bbb N}u_n$ dan tunjukkan bahwa $u\\wedge v=v$\nuntuk setiap $u\\in A$, sehingga $v=0$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S245"}
